| EMNLP 2025 | Jun 15, 2025 | Sep 2025 | Main |
| NeurIPS 2025 Workshops | Sep 2025 | Oct 2025 | Workshop |
| ICLR 2026 | Oct 2025 | Jan 2026 | Main |

**Recommendation:** Aim for **ACL 2025** (assuming current date is early 2025) or **EMNLP 2025** if you need more time.

